			description: [
				"the &6vehicle assembler&r multiblock builds cars, boats, and everything else with wheels or a hull. an MV machine hull, steel gearboxes, robot arms, and conveyors put it together."
				""
				"supports a &dparallel hatch&r and overclocks perfectly. you'll care about that later."
			]
			id: "15A9D0C4B7E82F30"
			subtitle: "some assembly required. all of it, actually"
