		{
			dependencies: ["1C00F1C2E3D4001B"]
			description: [
				"&astainless steel&r needs the EBF running at HV power: two MV energy hatches or one HV hatch. the coil tier doesn't matter here, just the amperage."
				""
				"&aadvanced integrated circuit&r is the HV circuit: transistors + capacitors + inductors + good integrated circuit in the MV assembler. finish both and HV opens."
			]
