		{
			dependencies: ["1C00F1C2E3D40004"]
			description: ["the &6MV gas turbine&r burns natural gas, methane, and most gaseous hydrocarbons. cleaner to run than steam if your chemistry line is already producing gas as a byproduct. the &6MV combustion engine&r burns liquid fuels like diesel and light fuel for similar output."]
			id: "1C00F1C2E3D40030"
