		{
			dependencies: ["1C00F1C2E3D40008"]
			description: [
				"the &6MV assembler&r produces &atransistors&r, &acapacitors&r, and &ainductors&r, the three components the advanced integrated circuit needs beyond a good integrated circuit."
				""
				"transistors need silicon wafers and PE. capacitors need PE and copper foil. inductors need nickel-zinc ferrite. build at least two assemblers: one for components, one for circuits."
			]
			id: "1C00F1C2E3D40040"
			shape: "rsquare"
