			description: [
				"&aplastic circuit boards&r are the substrate for the integrated and micro circuit lines. make the blank board from PE and glass fiber, then etch it with &3sodium persulfate&r or &3iron III chloride&r to get the plastic printed circuit board."
				""
				"automate the etch step. the circuit line goes through a lot of boards."
			]
